r from going bankrupt\u2014their wagging tails depend on you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/29c8a335badf0bad354ca4728203c6fc.poster.avif?t=1763626213\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/29c8a335badf0bad354ca4728203c6fc.webm?t=1763626213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/29c8a335badf0bad354ca4728203c6fc.mp4?t=1763626213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/7877a0f528affbd92338ce96decf2153.webp?t=1763626213\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World's Worst Handyman features stylized visuals and a playful blend of physics, stealth, and puzzles. It's bound to charm fans of Untitled Goose Game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the mayhem, save the animal shelter, and prove that even the world's worst handyman can be a hero!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333930/extras/0a9e099b587dc51be3a490acc054b727.webp?t=1763626213\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best of intentions. The worst of abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Task list of odd and potentially dangerous jobs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eccentric clients (possibly ulterior motives). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uptight neighbors tha